## 🏗️ Architecture

This repository adheres to `skills/gymnasium-env`:

- `src/{{ package_name }}/core/physics.py`: Headless deterministic physics transitions with `__slots__`.
- `src/{{ package_name }}/env/gym_env.py`: Farama Gymnasium `Env` subclass (`reset`, `step`, `render`, `close`).
- `src/{{ package_name }}/engine/renderer.py`: Raylib visual rendering using `import pyray as pr` for human observation mode.
- `src/{{ package_name }}/cli.py`: Google Fire CLI (`play`, `test_env`, `eval`).
- `src/{{ package_name }}/__init__.py`: Automatic Gymnasium environment registration.

AI agents working in this repository should refer to [`AGENTS.md`](file:///home/romuald/Projects/Perso/Skills/AGENTS.md) for architectural rules and Farama Gymnasium standards.
